    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consume. Grow. Dominate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Omnos: The Endless Journey, you play as an exotic particle from beyond this universe, driven by an insatiable hunger. Starting as a tiny speck of energy, your only goal is to absorb matter, grow stronger, and unlock new bonuses as you consume everything in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic arcade-style growth games, Omnos blends fast-paced action, minimalist visuals, and cosmic-scale evolution into an addictive game-play loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core Game-play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start Small, Grow Big. Begin as a small particle and grow by consuming other particles and entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve with Unique Abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow, unlock a variety of boosts such as moving faster, or even alter the laws of space to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose Yourself in the Flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive and simple controls, ambient audio, a relaxing soundtrack, and minimalist approach, Omnos delivers a zen-like intensity that\u2019s easy to pick up and hard to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-style level-up game-play with quick, satisfying progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looping growth mechanic\u2014absorb, evolve, repeat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level-up bonuses that affect your game-play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing music for that 5-minute break you need</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist controls (keyboard/mouse)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprehensive user manual bundled with the game</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consume. Grow. Dominate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Omnos: The Endless Journey, you play as an exotic particle from beyond this universe, driven by an insatiable hunger. Starting as a tiny speck of energy, your only goal is to absorb matter, grow stronger, and unlock new bonuses as you consume everything in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic arcade-style growth games, Omnos blends fast-paced action, minimalist visuals, and cosmic-scale evolution into an addictive game-play loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core Game-play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start Small, Grow Big. Begin as a small particle and grow by consuming other particles and entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve with Unique Abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow, unlock a variety of boosts such as moving faster, or even alter the laws of space to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose Yourself in the Flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive and simple controls, ambient audio, a relaxing soundtrack, and minimalist approach, Omnos delivers a zen-like intensity that\u2019s easy to pick up and hard to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-style level-up game-play with quick, satisfying progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looping growth mechanic\u2014absorb, evolve, repeat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level-up bonuses that affect your game-play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing music for that 5-minute break you need</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist controls (keyboard/mouse)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprehensive user manual bundled with the game</p>",
